  family   an ordinary question from pb_families; the answer is program, check table, `certified`, run, answer.
  verify   either of the above with 1-3 check rows corrupted in the context (the wrong value is never a training
           target); the target is ✗ on each corrupted row, then `not certified`, a fresh correct check table, and the
           rest as usual.
