Literal-table programs and span-quoted tapes for the pinned mode (DEMO_DESIGN §2.1, §2.4 R2, §2.6).

A family question becomes this response (ordinary decoding):

    <program>
    task: which spot hides the coin after the swaps
    input: the swaps in order
    tape: after "Swaps, in order: " until ". Where is the coin"
    register ball: start C
     A AB B
     A BC A
