+
+## 4. Data-only outcome and frozen intervention predictions
+
+**Unaudited; prediction FAIL.** The original registration is commit `65282f1`, the
+pre-fit boundary amendment is `6f8b353`, and the estimator implementation at first
+execution is `223477f`. The inherited, uncommitted `results/estimate.json` was
+recomputed before the intervention, with identical contents. Its field
+`registration_commit` actually records the implementation HEAD (`223477f`), not
